CalldataSliceLib::sliceBool
├── given zero byte
│   ├── it should return false
│   └── it should return offset + 1
├── given 0x01 byte
│   ├── it should return true
│   └── it should return offset + 1
├── given non-zero byte (0xFF)
│   └── it should return true
└── given sequential reads
    └── it should read each bool correctly with advancing offset